---
import type { Locale } from '../../i18n';
import { localePath } from '../../i18n';

interface Props { locale: Locale }
const { locale } = Astro.props;
const zh = locale === 'zh';
const t = (cn: string, en: string) => zh ? cn : en;

const steps = [
  {
    index: 'N1',
    title: t('先复现 SEED 公共代码的任务语义', 'Reconstruct SEED public-code task semantics first'),
    body: t(
      '解析兼容修复已经跑完。现在最近的一步不是再改 parser，而是按固定版本的 SEED 公开代码重建首次验证的 128 个任务槽位：把 validation seed、每个 worker seed、实际 instruction 和数据身份一起冻结，并用两次干净重建得到同一个哈希后才允许正式 GPU 评测。BASE 与 OpenEvo SD-LoRA 都保持冻结，不重新训练。',
      'The parser-compatible rerun is already complete. The nearest step is no longer another parser change: rebuild the 128 first-validation task slots from the pinned SEED public code, freezing the validation seed, each worker seed, resulting instruction, and data identity. Two clean rebuilds must produce the same hash before formal GPU evaluation is allowed. BASE and OpenEvo SD-LoRA remain frozen; neither is retrained.',
    ),
  },
  {
    index: 'N2',
    title: t('再解决第二代“学新忘旧”', 'Then address second-generation forgetting'),
    body: t(
      '第二代更新的问题不是“没有新经验”，而是新经验、旧能力和第一代已经得到的收益没有一起保住。下一轮要围绕经验回放（Experience Replay）和正则化重新测试这三件事。',
      'The second-generation problem is not a lack of new experience; the new experience, prior capability, and the replicated first-generation gain were not preserved together. The next mechanism work should retest those three properties with experience replay and regularization.',
    ),
  },
  {
    index: 'N3',
    title: t('最后用 ALFWorld 检查是否只对 WebShop 有效', 'Use ALFWorld to test WebShop specificity'),
    body: t(
      '如果单步迁移和多代更新在 WebShop 上变得稳定，再把同一套实验问题带到 ALFWorld，检查这些现象是不是只依赖 WebShop 的任务分布。',
      'If one-step transfer and multi-generation updating become stable on WebShop, carry the same scientific questions to ALFWorld to test whether the findings depend on WebShop-specific task structure.',
    ),
  },
] as const;
---

<section class="next-steps" id="next-steps" aria-labelledby="next-steps-title">
  <header class="section-heading">
    <p>NEXT STEPS</p>
    <div>
      <h2 id="next-steps-title">{t('接下来最重要的三件事', 'The three most important next steps')}</h2>
      <p>{t(
        '解析兼容问题已经完成修复复测；新的最近一步是把“在 0–499 范围里测”进一步收紧成“按 SEED 公共代码真实生成同一类首次验证任务”。这个任务语义通过机械验证后，再继续正式比较；多代更新与跨环境泛化仍是后面的两道关。',
        'The parser-compatible rerun is complete. The nearest step is now to tighten “evaluate within 0–499” into “mechanically reproduce the first-validation task semantics generated by the released SEED code.” Once that task construction is verified, the formal comparison can proceed; multi-generation updating and cross-environment generalization remain the next two gates.',
      )}</p>
    </div>
  </header>

  <ol class="step-list">
    {steps.map((step) => (
      <li class="step-card">
        <span class="step-index">{step.index}</span>
        <div>
          <h3>{step.title}</h3>
          <p>{step.body}</p>
        </div>
      </li>
    ))}
  </ol>

  <aside class="min-gap">
    <p>{t(
      '后续 WebShop benchmark 现在明确分成两条：Track A 复现 SEED 公共代码可恢复的任务语义；WB1 属于 Track B，在同一个冻结世界和预算下做公平 matched benchmark。两条线回答的问题不同，结果不能互相冒充。',
      'Future WebShop benchmarking is now split explicitly into two tracks: Track A reproduces task semantics recoverable from the released SEED code; WB1 belongs to Track B, a fair matched benchmark under one frozen world and matched budgets. The tracks answer different questions and their results are not interchangeable.',
    )} <a href={localePath(locale, '/research/seed-openevo/experiment/')}>{t('查看实验设定 ↗', 'See the experiment setup ↗')}</a></p>
  </aside>
</section>

<style>
  .next-steps{max-width:1160px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 24px 52px;color:var(--color-text)}
  .section-heading{display:grid;grid-template-columns:145px minmax(0,760px);gap:28px;padding:38px 0 24px;border-top:1px solid var(--color-border)}
  .section-heading>p{margin:5px 0 0;color:var(--color-text-muted);font-size:.73rem;font-weight:750;letter-spacing:.14em}
  .section-heading h2{margin:0 0 8px;font-size:clamp(1.55rem,3vw,2.5rem);line-height:1.12;letter-spacing:-.035em}
  .section-heading div>p{margin:0;max-width:66ch;color:var(--color-text-muted);font-size:.94rem;line-height:1.68}
  .step-list{list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0;display:grid;gap:10px}
  .step-card{display:grid;grid-template-columns:62px minmax(0,1fr);gap:20px;padding:22px 24px;border:1px solid var(--color-border);border-radius:15px;background:var(--color-bg)}
  .step-index{color:var(--color-accent);font:700 .82rem ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace}
  .step-card h3{margin:0 0 6px;font-size:1.05rem;letter-spacing:-.02em}
  .step-card p{margin:0;max-width:76ch;color:var(--color-text-muted);font-size:.87rem;line-height:1.68}
  .min-gap{margin-top:12px;padding:18px 22px;border-left:3px solid var(--color-accent);border-radius:0 12px 12px 0;background:var(--color-surface)}
  .min-gap p{margin:0;max-width:82ch;font-size:.86rem;line-height:1.66}
  .min-gap a{color:var(--color-accent);font-weight:750;text-decoration:none}
  .min-gap a:hover{text-decoration:underline}
  @media(max-width:720px){
    .next-steps{padding-inline:18px}
    .section-heading{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:8px}
    .step-card{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:8px;padding:18px}
  }
</style>
